<title>SPAIN: Spain's Galicia to issue 17 bln pta 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Spain's Galicia to issue 17 bln pta 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's regional government of Galicia (Xunta de Galicia) is to launch 17 billion pesetas in 10-year bonds, according to Ceca-Ahorro Corporacion Financiera.</p>
<p>The bond, with a nominal value of 100,000 pesetas, will pay a 6.65 percent coupon and will mature on June 24, 2007.</p>
<p>Ceca-Ahorro Corporacion Financiera will lead the issue with BCH and Caixa de Vigo.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
